{"vid":"RvUW2-oUOGo","source":"RvUW2-oUOGo.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"HISE O. GIBSON: I absolutely believe"},{"t":2.2,"txt":"that a corporate setting could benefit from a more"},{"t":5.3,"txt":"direct communication style."},{"t":7.2,"txt":"At the culmination of my military career,"},{"t":9.4,"txt":"I retired as a Colonel in the US Army."},{"t":11.8,"txt":"Being direct is a very normal way"},{"t":14.5,"txt":"in which to communicate in the military."},{"t":16.6,"txt":"You mean what you say, and you say what you mean."},{"t":18.8,"txt":"It doesn't mean knife hand, like, you do what I say."},{"t":23.5,"txt":"But it does mean, this is what we need."},{"t":26.4,"txt":"This is why we need it."},{"t":27.6,"txt":"Here are the expectations."},{"t":29,"txt":"Here's how I need it to end."},{"t":31.3,"txt":"That framework is what I've used for 25 years,"},{"t":36.4,"txt":"and we call it commander's intent."},{"t":38.4,"txt":"[MUSIC PLAYING]"},{"t":40.1,"txt":"So the idea of commander's intent,"},{"t":41.8,"txt":"it's something that comes from mission command."},{"t":44.6,"txt":"Mission command allows for centralized command,"},{"t":47.1,"txt":"but decentralized execution."},{"t":48.5,"txt":"And isn't that what we all want as leaders?"},{"t":50.3,"txt":"We want to be able to tell people what we want."},{"t":52.8,"txt":"They go off and do amazing things."},{"t":54.6,"txt":"What normally happens is we tell people what we want."},{"t":57.3,"txt":"They have no idea what was just said."},{"t":59.6,"txt":"They don't ask for clarification."},{"t":61.2,"txt":"And then we're upset two weeks later that-- what happened?"},{"t":64.2,"txt":"At least in the military, every operation I've ever done,"},{"t":67.8,"txt":"no matter whether you're doing physical training"},{"t":69.8,"txt":"in the morning, going on a march, doing a convoy,"},{"t":72.9,"txt":"doing an aviation flight brief, we provide some kind of intent."},{"t":76.7,"txt":"And all that is is three things."},{"t":78.7,"txt":"You provide the why."},{"t":80.3,"txt":"Why are we doing this?"},{"t":82.2,"txt":"What do we want?"},{"t":83.6,"txt":"What is expected?"},{"t":84.7,"txt":"And we use terms like key task."},{"t":86.9,"txt":"We don't mean a 20-list, a 20-bullet-point priority list."},{"t":93.2,"txt":"Three to five things."},{"t":95.2,"txt":"What do we want?"},{"t":96.3,"txt":"What is expected?"},{"t":97.4,"txt":"And then the key thing that is critical that really makes"},{"t":102.3,"txt":"sometimes corporate leaders uncomfortable is providing,"},{"t":105.2,"txt":"how do I want it to end?"},{"t":107,"txt":"What is the end state?"},{"t":108.3,"txt":"Meaning, if this was a book, what's the next chapter?"},{"t":111.5,"txt":"How do I want to be set after we're done with this?"},{"t":115,"txt":"What that provides is a level of accountability to the leader."},{"t":118.8,"txt":"If a leader has to communicate, this is why we're doing this,"},{"t":122,"txt":"here are the key tasks that need to be completed in order"},{"t":125.3,"txt":"for this operation not to fail, and here's how I want it to end,"},{"t":131.3,"txt":"that should be enough for people to go out and be awesome."},{"t":136.3,"txt":"Sometimes leaders I've observed in corporate settings,"},{"t":140.4,"txt":"they do provide what, but they get too granular in the what."},{"t":144.3,"txt":"If we're experts in anything-- like, I'm a pilot."},{"t":147.1,"txt":"I was a pilot in the army."},{"t":148.4,"txt":"And so if one of my peers who was not a pilot"},{"t":151.9,"txt":"tried to explain to me how to be a pilot,"},{"t":154.6,"txt":"I might be a little upset about that."},{"t":157.1,"txt":"Just tell me what you want."},{"t":158.8,"txt":"Oh, you want me to move food to you."},{"t":161.2,"txt":"You want me to bring you water."},{"t":162.5,"txt":"You need me to transport you from point A to point B. Got it."},{"t":166.2,"txt":"I'll take care of the flying part."},{"t":167.9,"txt":"You just tell me what you want."},{"t":169.5,"txt":"Don't tell me how to do my job."},{"t":171,"txt":"There's a lot of really smart teammates that we have"},{"t":173.2,"txt":"who we hire because they're awesome."},{"t":174.9,"txt":"But if we start to tell them how to do stuff,"},{"t":177,"txt":"we actually start to stunt their growth."},{"t":178.6,"txt":"If you keep telling people how to do things, at some point,"},{"t":181.1,"txt":"they're just going to wait to be told."},{"t":182.8,"txt":"And then they don't exercise the initiative that we hope"},{"t":187.2,"txt":"and want them to exercise in order for all of us"},{"t":189.7,"txt":"to be effective."},{"t":191.5,"txt":"There's a place in Louisiana that"},{"t":193.7,"txt":"used to be called Fort Polk."},{"t":195.7,"txt":"It's a training area."},{"t":197.1,"txt":"And so every month, about 10,000 soldiers go and train at this"},{"t":202.3,"txt":"place."},{"t":202.8,"txt":"And I went there a lot when I was in the 82nd Airborne"},{"t":205.4,"txt":"Division."},{"t":205.9,"txt":"This one time I was there, and the senior leader,"},{"t":208.3,"txt":"the colonel in charge--"},{"t":209.3,"txt":"I was one of the commanders and we were"},{"t":210.9,"txt":"having a commander meeting."},{"t":212.4,"txt":"He provided his intent."},{"t":213.9,"txt":"He gives a slide with, like, 10 sentences."},{"t":217.5,"txt":"And those 10 sentences guided an operation that were going"},{"t":221.7,"txt":"to move 6,000 to 8,000 people in a certain direction."},{"t":226.3,"txt":"All the senior leaders are all in the room, and each of us"},{"t":229.3,"txt":"knew what our part was in this paragraph."},{"t":232.6,"txt":"We need to move x amount of people to this place"},{"t":237.3,"txt":"in order to do this thing."},{"t":240.1,"txt":"Well, the only way they can move is if they move by helicopter."},{"t":242.7,"txt":"OK, so that's me."},{"t":244.2,"txt":"And then on the back end, what's not said"},{"t":246.8,"txt":"is for an operation like this, oh, you're"},{"t":249.2,"txt":"also going to need medical evacuation."},{"t":251.3,"txt":"It doesn't have to be said explicitly,"},{"t":253.5,"txt":"but safety and keeping soldiers--"},{"t":256.8,"txt":"taking care of when they're injured"},{"t":258.7,"txt":"is an implied reality in any major operation."},{"t":261.5,"txt":"Does not need to be said."},{"t":263.3,"txt":"Each of the 10 leaders all knew what our part was."},{"t":267,"txt":"If we were unclear, we could immediately ask on the spot"},{"t":270.3,"txt":"or verify with our peers to the left or right of us"},{"t":273.6,"txt":"what needed to happen so that we were aligned."},{"t":276.7,"txt":"When we provide the end state or how"},{"t":279.9,"txt":"we want something to end, what we've just"},{"t":282.5,"txt":"done as a leader is actually given ourselves accountability,"},{"t":286.7,"txt":"that if you meet this mark, if you cross the finish line,"},{"t":291,"txt":"I don't care how you do it, as long"},{"t":294.2,"txt":"as you don't do something illegal, unethical, or immoral."},{"t":298.7,"txt":"You might not do it the way that I did it."},{"t":301,"txt":"You might find some new way."},{"t":302.5,"txt":"You might take a little bit longer."},{"t":304.2,"txt":"But as long as you meet the mark, we're good."},{"t":307.1,"txt":"So you provided latitude."},{"t":308.8,"txt":"And some may fall into the trap to believe,"},{"t":313.2,"txt":"if I give this information, I'm going to stunt innovation."},{"t":316.9,"txt":"But by setting the expectation clearly,"},{"t":319.7,"txt":"you've actually stoked innovation"},{"t":322.8,"txt":"because that person has to figure out"},{"t":324.7,"txt":"how to meet the bar in which you set."},{"t":328,"txt":"If we set high standards, our teammates"},{"t":332,"txt":"are going to meet it consistently."}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"HISE"},{"t":0,"w":"O."},{"t":0,"w":"GIBSON:"},{"t":0,"w":"I"},{"t":0,"w":"absolutely"},{"t":0,"w":"believe"},{"t":2.18,"w":"that"},{"t":2.18,"w":"a"},{"t":2.18,"w":"corporate"},{"t":2.18,"w":"setting"},{"t":2.18,"w":"could"},{"t":2.18,"w":"benefit"},{"t":2.18,"w":"from"},{"t":2.18,"w":"a"},{"t":2.18,"w":"more"},{"t":5.27,"w":"direct"},{"t":5.27,"w":"communication"},{"t":5.27,"w":"style."},{"t":7.2,"w":"At"},{"t":7.2,"w":"the"},{"t":7.2,"w":"culmination"},{"t":7.2,"w":"of"},{"t":7.2,"w":"my"},{"t":7.2,"w":"military"},{"t":7.2,"w":"career,"},{"t":9.39,"w":"I"},{"t":9.39,"w":"retired"},{"t":9.39,"w":"as"},{"t":9.39,"w":"a"},{"t":9.39,"w":"Colonel"},{"t":9.39,"w":"in"},{"t":9.39,"w":"the"},{"t":9.39,"w":"US"},{"t":9.39,"w":"Army."},{"t":11.76,"w":"Being"},{"t":11.76,"w":"direct"},{"t":11.76,"w":"is"},{"t":11.76,"w":"a"},{"t":11.76,"w":"very"},{"t":11.76,"w":"normal"},{"t":11.76,"w":"way"},{"t":14.48,"w":"in"},{"t":14.48,"w":"which"},{"t":14.48,"w":"to"},{"t":14.48,"w":"communicate"},{"t":14.48,"w":"in"},{"t":14.48,"w":"the"},{"t":14.48,"w":"military."},{"t":16.62,"w":"You"},{"t":16.62,"w":"mean"},{"t":16.62,"w":"what"},{"t":16.62,"w":"you"},{"t":16.62,"w":"say,"},{"t":16.62,"w":"and"},{"t":16.62,"w":"you"},{"t":16.62,"w":"say"},{"t":16.62,"w":"what"},{"t":16.62,"w":"you"},{"t":16.62,"w":"mean."},{"t":18.75,"w":"It"},{"t":18.75,"w":"doesn't"},{"t":18.75,"w":"mean"},{"t":18.75,"w":"knife"},{"t":18.75,"w":"hand,"},{"t":18.75,"w":"like,"},{"t":18.75,"w":"you"},{"t":18.75,"w":"do"},{"t":18.75,"w":"what"},{"t":18.75,"w":"I"},{"t":18.75,"w":"say."},{"t":23.52,"w":"But"},{"t":23.52,"w":"it"},{"t":23.52,"w":"does"},{"t":23.52,"w":"mean,"},{"t":23.52,"w":"this"},{"t":23.52,"w":"is"},{"t":23.52,"w":"what"},{"t":23.52,"w":"we"},{"t":23.52,"w":"need."},{"t":26.4,"w":"This"},{"t":26.4,"w":"is"},{"t":26.4,"w":"why"},{"t":26.4,"w":"we"},{"t":26.4,"w":"need"},{"t":26.4,"w":"it."},{"t":27.63,"w":"Here"},{"t":27.63,"w":"are"},{"t":27.63,"w":"the"},{"t":27.63,"w":"expectations."},{"t":29.01,"w":"Here's"},{"t":29.01,"w":"how"},{"t":29.01,"w":"I"},{"t":29.01,"w":"need"},{"t":29.01,"w":"it"},{"t":29.01,"w":"to"},{"t":29.01,"w":"end."},{"t":31.325,"w":"That"},{"t":31.325,"w":"framework"},{"t":31.325,"w":"is"},{"t":31.325,"w":"what"},{"t":31.325,"w":"I've"},{"t":31.325,"w":"used"},{"t":31.325,"w":"for"},{"t":31.325,"w":"25"},{"t":31.325,"w":"years,"},{"t":36.44,"w":"and"},{"t":36.44,"w":"we"},{"t":36.44,"w":"call"},{"t":36.44,"w":"it"},{"t":36.44,"w":"commander's"},{"t":36.44,"w":"intent."},{"t":38.425,"w":"[MUSIC"},{"t":38.425,"w":"PLAYING]"},{"t":40.1,"w":"So"},{"t":40.1,"w":"the"},{"t":40.1,"w":"idea"},{"t":40.1,"w":"of"},{"t":40.1,"w":"commander's"},{"t":40.1,"w":"intent,"},{"t":41.79,"w":"it's"},{"t":41.79,"w":"something"},{"t":41.79,"w":"that"},{"t":41.79,"w":"comes"},{"t":41.79,"w":"from"},{"t":41.79,"w":"mission"},{"t":41.79,"w":"command."},{"t":44.59,"w":"Mission"},{"t":44.59,"w":"command"},{"t":44.59,"w":"allows"},{"t":44.59,"w":"for"},{"t":44.59,"w":"centralized"},{"t":44.59,"w":"command,"},{"t":47.13,"w":"but"},{"t":47.13,"w":"decentralized"},{"t":47.13,"w":"execution."},{"t":48.548,"w":"And"},{"t":48.548,"w":"isn't"},{"t":48.548,"w":"that"},{"t":48.548,"w":"what"},{"t":48.548,"w":"we"},{"t":48.548,"w":"all"},{"t":48.548,"w":"want"},{"t":48.548,"w":"as"},{"t":48.548,"w":"leaders?"},{"t":50.34,"w":"We"},{"t":50.34,"w":"want"},{"t":50.34,"w":"to"},{"t":50.34,"w":"be"},{"t":50.34,"w":"able"},{"t":50.34,"w":"to"},{"t":50.34,"w":"tell"},{"t":50.34,"w":"people"},{"t":50.34,"w":"what"},{"t":50.34,"w":"we"},{"t":50.34,"w":"want."},{"t":52.83,"w":"They"},{"t":52.83,"w":"go"},{"t":52.83,"w":"off"},{"t":52.83,"w":"and"},{"t":52.83,"w":"do"},{"t":52.83,"w":"amazing"},{"t":52.83,"w":"things."},{"t":54.6,"w":"What"},{"t":54.6,"w":"normally"},{"t":54.6,"w":"happens"},{"t":54.6,"w":"is"},{"t":54.6,"w":"we"},{"t":54.6,"w":"tell"},{"t":54.6,"w":"people"},{"t":54.6,"w":"what"},{"t":54.6,"w":"we"},{"t":54.6,"w":"want."},{"t":57.27,"w":"They"},{"t":57.27,"w":"have"},{"t":57.27,"w":"no"},{"t":57.27,"w":"idea"},{"t":57.27,"w":"what"},{"t":57.27,"w":"was"},{"t":57.27,"w":"just"},{"t":57.27,"w":"said."},{"t":59.58,"w":"They"},{"t":59.58,"w":"don't"},{"t":59.58,"w":"ask"},{"t":59.58,"w":"for"